{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人梁杰文於節目中推介網易(9999)，指公司近期轉為雙重主要上市，被納入港股通後資金持續流入，另外推出的新遊戲，市場反應不俗，股價在近月大市波動下亦相對穩定。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3323.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026KGCjNTI0Ly1785306464.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3323.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">黃敏碩建議195元買入，目標價上望220元，若失守170元便止蝕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網易(9999)買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入：$195</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標：$220</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕：$170</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3324.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026EBwURdMk8I1785306454.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3324.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人阮子曦推介中金公司(3908)，A股交投活躍，同時IPO熱潮爆發，另外集團重組方案有進展，相信重組後可望推動整體業務及盈利增長。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3325.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026t08pB7ndea1785306495.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3325.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">阮子曦建議現價21.12元吸納，目標價看25元，止蝕價定於19元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中金公司(3908)買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入：現價→$21.12入</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標：$25</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕：$19</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3326.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026PWvtmVAma01785306520.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3326.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-29T06:58:53.881390+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":297,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}